    {
      "type": {
        "id": 14,
        "name": "Réponse CF / Bureau"
      },
      "value": "<div><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:6pt; text-align:justify; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">1. Par «</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&#xa0;</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">abattage</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&#xa0;</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">», on entend, conformément à l’art.</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&#xa0;</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">3, let.</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&#xa0;</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">n, de l’ordonnance concernant l’abattage d’animaux et le contrôle des viandes (OAbCV</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&#xa0;</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">; RS</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&#xa0;</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">817.190), la mise à mort d’un animal et la découpe de la carcasse en six morceaux au plus ainsi que le dépouillement ou la plumaison du gibier sauvage et la découpe de la carcasse en six morceaux au plus à des fins de production de denrées alimentaires. </span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:6pt; text-align:justify; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:11.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%; font-family:Arial; font-size:11pt\">2. En 2023, les abattoirs dans lesquels aucun animal n’a été abattu étaient au nombre de 166, mais selon l’art.</span><span style=\"line-height:150%; font-family:Arial; font-size:11pt\">&#xa0;</span><span style=\"line-height:150%; font-family:Arial; font-size:11pt\">6 OAbCV des animaux peuvent en principe être abattus dans tout abattoir disposant d’une autorisation cantonale d’exploiter. Or l’autorisation d’exploitation n’est retirée que si les charges dont elle est assortie ne sont pas respectées, si l’hygiène de l’abattage a fait l’objet de contestations répétées, si les non-conformités ne sont pas corrigées dans les délais impartis ou si </span><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica; color:#454545; background-color:#ffffff\">des infractions graves et répétées à la législation sur la protection des animaux ont été commises</span><span style=\"line-height:150%; font-family:Arial; font-size:11pt\"> (art.</span><span style=\"line-height:150%; font-family:Arial; font-size:11pt\">&#xa0;</span><span style=\"line-height:150%; font-family:Arial; font-size:11pt\">6, al.</span><span style=\"line-height:150%; font-family:Arial; font-size:11pt\">&#xa0;</span><span style=\"line-height:150%; font-family:Arial; font-size:11pt\">6, OAbCV).</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:6pt; text-align:justify; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">3. En 2023, les abattoirs dans lesquels au moins 100</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&#xa0;</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">animaux ont été abattus étaient 363</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&#xa0;</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">: les animaux pris en compte étaient des bovins, des porcs, des moutons, des chèvres et des chevaux. Ne sont pas compris dans ce total les abattoirs qui abattent des volailles, car leurs déclarations d’abattage ne mentionnent pas le nombre d’animaux abattus, mais leur poids. Il n’existe pas de statistiques publiques à ce sujet. L’Office fédéral de la sécurité alimentaire et des affaires vétérinaires (OSAV) publie cependant chaque année la statistique du contrôle des viandes, qui recense les animaux abattus dans toute la Suisse et par canton (</span><a href=\"http://www.osav.admin.ch\" style=\"text-decoration:none\">www.osav.admin.ch</a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> &gt; Aliments et nutrition &gt; Publications &gt; Statistiques et rapports sur la sécurité des aliments &gt; Contrôle des viandes).</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:justify; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">4. Le tableau ci-dessous indique le nombre d’abattoirs dans toute la Suisse et par canton qui ont abattu au moins 1</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&#xa0;</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">animal (2</span><span style=\"line-height:150%; font-family:Arial; font-size:7.33pt; vertical-align:super\">e</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&#xa0;</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">colonne) ou au moins 100</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&#xa0;</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">animaux (3</span><span style=\"line-height:150%; font-family:Arial; font-size:7.33pt; vertical-align:super\">e</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&#xa0;</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">colonne) en 2023</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&#xa0;</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">:</span></p><table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"width:216.4pt; border-collapse:collapse\"><tr style=\"height:15.95pt\"><td style=\"width:41.2pt; border-top:1pt solid #ffffff; border-right:1pt solid #ffffff; border-left:1pt solid #ffffff; border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:1pt; padding-right:3pt; padding-left:3pt; vertical-align:bottom; background-color:#ffffff\"><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:8pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial; font-weight:bold\">Canton</span></p></td><td style=\"width:72.35pt; border-top:1pt solid #ffffff; border-right:1pt solid #ffffff; border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:1pt; padding-right:3pt; padding-left:3.5pt; vertical-align:bottom; background-color:#ffffff\"><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:8pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial; font-weight:bold\">Abattoirs avec un abattage en 2023</span></p></td><td style=\"width:80.85pt; border-top:1pt solid #ffffff; border-right:1pt solid #ffffff; border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:1pt; padding-right:3pt; padding-left:3.5pt; vertical-align:bottom; background-color:#ffffff\"><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:8pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial; font-weight:bold\">dont ceux avec au moins 100 abattages en 2023</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height:12.75pt\"><td style=\"width:41.2pt; border-right:1pt solid #ffffff; border-left:1pt solid #ffffff; border-bottom:1pt solid #c0c0c0; padding-right:3pt; padding-left:3pt; vertical-align:bottom; background-color:#ffffff\"><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:8pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">AG</span></p></td><td style=\"width:72.35pt; border-right:1pt solid #ffffff; border-bottom:1pt solid #c0c0c0; padding-right:3pt; padding-left:3.5pt; vertical-align:bottom; background-color:#ffffff\"><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:right; font-size:8pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">31</span></p></td><td style=\"width:80.85pt; border-right:1pt solid #ffffff; border-bottom:1pt solid #c0c0c0; padding-right:3pt; padding-left:3.5pt; vertical-align:bottom; background-color:#ffffff\"><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:right; font-size:8pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">25</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height:12.75pt\"><td style=\"width:41.2pt; border-right:1pt solid #ffffff; border-left:1pt solid #ffffff; border-bottom:1pt solid #c0c0c0; padding-right:3pt; padding-left:3pt; vertical-align:bottom; background-color:#ffffff\"><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:8pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">AI</span></p></td><td style=\"width:72.35pt; border-right:1pt solid #ffffff; border-bottom:1pt solid #c0c0c0; padding-right:3pt; padding-left:3.5pt; vertical-align:bottom; background-color:#ffffff\"><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:right; font-size:8pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">2</span></p></td><td style=\"width:80.85pt; border-right:1pt solid #ffffff; border-bottom:1pt solid #c0c0c0; padding-right:3pt; padding-left:3.5pt; vertical-align:bottom; background-color:#ffffff\"><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:right; font-size:8pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">2</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height:12.75pt\"><td style=\"width:41.2pt; border-right:1pt solid #ffffff; border-left:1pt solid #ffffff; border-bottom:1pt solid #c0c0c0; padding-right:3pt; padding-left:3pt; vertical-align:bottom; background-color:#ffffff\"><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:8pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">AR</span></p></td><td style=\"width:72.35pt; border-right:1pt solid #ffffff; border-bottom:1pt solid #c0c0c0; padding-right:3pt; padding-left:3.5pt; vertical-align:bottom; background-color:#ffffff\"><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:right; font-size:8pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">6</span></p></td><td style=\"width:80.85pt; border-right:1pt solid #ffffff; border-bottom:1pt solid #c0c0c0; padding-right:3pt; padding-left:3.5pt; vertical-align:bottom; background-color:#ffffff\"><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:right; font-size:8pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">6</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height:12.75pt\"><td style=\"width:41.2pt; border-right:1pt solid #ffffff; border-left:1pt solid #ffffff; border-bottom:1pt solid #c0c0c0; padding-right:3pt; padding-left:3pt; vertical-align:bottom; background-color:#ffffff\"><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:8pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">BE</span></p></td><td style=\"width:72.35pt; border-right:1pt solid #ffffff; border-bottom:1pt solid #c0c0c0; padding-right:3pt; padding-left:3.5pt; vertical-align:bottom; background-color:#ffffff\"><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:right; font-size:8pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">107</span></p></td><td style=\"width:80.85pt; border-right:1pt solid #ffffff; border-bottom:1pt solid #c0c0c0; padding-right:3pt; padding-left:3.5pt; vertical-align:bottom; background-color:#ffffff\"><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:right; font-size:8pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">87</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height:12.75pt\"><td style=\"width:41.2pt; border-right:1pt solid #ffffff; border-left:1pt solid #ffffff; border-bottom:1pt solid #c0c0c0; padding-right:3pt; padding-left:3pt; vertical-align:bottom; background-color:#ffffff\"><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:8pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">BL</span></p></td><td style=\"width:72.35pt; border-right:1pt solid #ffffff; border-bottom:1pt solid #c0c0c0; padding-right:3pt; padding-left:3.5pt; vertical-align:bottom; background-color:#ffffff\"><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:right; font-size:8pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">15</span></p></td><td style=\"width:80.85pt; border-right:1pt solid #ffffff; border-bottom:1pt solid #c0c0c0; padding-right:3pt; padding-left:3.5pt; vertical-align:bottom; background-color:#ffffff\"><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:right; font-size:8pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">10</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height:12.75pt\"><td style=\"width:41.2pt; border-right:1pt solid #ffffff; border-left:1pt solid #ffffff; border-bottom:1pt solid #c0c0c0; padding-right:3pt; padding-left:3pt; vertical-align:bottom; background-color:#ffffff\"><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:8pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">BS</span></p></td><td style=\"width:72.35pt; border-right:1pt solid #ffffff; border-bottom:1pt solid #c0c0c0; padding-right:3pt; padding-left:3.5pt; vertical-align:bottom; background-color:#ffffff\"><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:right; font-size:8pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">2</span></p></td><td style=\"width:80.85pt; border-right:1pt solid #ffffff; border-bottom:1pt solid #c0c0c0; padding-right:3pt; padding-left:3.5pt; vertical-align:bottom; background-color:#ffffff\"><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:right; font-size:8pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">2</span></p></td></tr><tr 